  "notes": "Issue #457. Leakage-safe outer 5-fold cross-fitted multinomial Logistic Regression (strong L2, C=0.2, same hyperparameters as EXP-137's precedent) over EXP-374 and EXP-449 OOF probabilities (52-dim concatenation). For each outer fold, the meta learner is fit only on the other four folds' base OOF rows and predicts the held-out fold -- base OOF probabilities are themselves already out-of-fold with respect to the base models, so no row's true label ever influences its own meta-feature. No Optuna, no hyperparameter search. A mandatory train_domain_propensity.csv test-like subset check (same boundary as EXP-351/EXP-450) is required before any adoption decision, to catch an EXP-253/EXP-450-style Local-pass/test- like-fail pattern."
}
